{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>does not contain microtransactions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459540/extras/Click_for_humanity_Demo.png?t=1746184015\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Click for humanity Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generate energy, and colonize the entire universe! Click for Humanity is an idle game. Start from Earth and take control of the entire solar system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is the demo version of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459540/extras/Generate_Energy.png?t=1746184015\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Generate energy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generate energy to progress and buy things</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459540/extras/Explore_all_the_planet.png?t=1746184015\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore all the planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore all the planets | <strong>Only 2 planets are available in the demo version.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459540/extras/Dying_Worlds.png?t=1746184015\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dying Planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All planets are slowly dying, and their efficiency is declining. However, you can revive them and boost their efficiency by planting trees!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random events happen depending on your clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A New Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3459540/0e13c6f592717b1408d46f391394fdffa3b40d8a.jp